      "known_gaps": [
        "CMS source completeness is bounded by the owner's source registry and retained release. It is not clinical publication or review coverage.",
        "Registry-owned metadata is declared by explicit per-dataset paths matching the cms_collect.py registry. Any other retained file remains undeclared inventory.",
        "cms_collect.py collect refuses an output directory that already holds a completed manifest. Wiring a new --output directory is an explicit operator action that this workflow never composes.",
        "A present manifest.partial.json or pending-request.json records an interrupted or pending collection. It is reported as retained inventory, never promoted to verified or complete."
      ]
